        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: St. John's College, Belize\n- People: Jorge Espat\n- Concepts: Liberal arts education\n- Places: Belize City\n\nFacts:\n- Liberal arts education traditionally centered on grammar, logic, and rhetoric, with arithmetic, geometry, the theory of music, and astronomy also included in education.\n- St. John's College in Belize offers liberal arts and science courses through three divisions at the secondary, British A-level, and United States junior college levels.\n- Jorge Espat served on the faculty of St. John's College in Belize City as an instructor and later as president.",
